ut we would necessarily pull their cost out.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/04/26/encompass-health-corporation-ehc-q1-2019-earnings.aspx"},{"c":"EHC 2019 Q1","e":"ehc","d":"2019-04-26","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Mark J. Tarr","x":"As a result of our strong start to 2019 and our current expectations for the remainder of 2019, included the impact of the 2020 proposed rule for inpatient rehabilitation hospitals on the fourth quarter of 2019, we are reiterating our full year guidance.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/04/26/encompass-health-corporation-ehc-q1-2019-earnings.aspx"},{"c":"EHC 2019 Q2","e":"ehc","d":"2019-07-30","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Douglas E. Coltharp","x":"…sector and do the same kind of math with the 0% to 25% reduction for the first three quarters and a more normalized increase in the fourth quarter, you run all of that through, you're going to wind up with a net positive pricing increase, probably somewhere between a 0.5% and 0.75% for the year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/07/30/encompass-health-corporation-ehc-q2-2019-earnings.aspx"},{"c":"EHC 2019 Q2","e":"ehc","d":"2019-07-30","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Douglas E. Coltharp","x":"And so that'll generate incremental revenue somewhere between $25 million and $30 million, but against that level of price increase, you're going to continue to have the risk of SWB de-levering and so that might create another $30 million or $35 million headwind.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/07/30/encompass-health-corporation-ehc-q2-2019-earnings.aspx"},{"c":"EHC 2019 Q3","e":"ehc","d":"2019-10-29","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Douglas Coltharp","x":"…will carry in to 2020 from the 2019 base across both business segments due to deleveraging these price increases against SWB has improved by $20 million to $30 million and so when we think of what we need to achieve in 2020, solely on the back of volume growth, that burden has come down. Got to…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/30/encompass-health-corporation-ehc-q3-2019-earnings.aspx"},{"c":"EHC 2019 Q4","e":"ehc","d":"2020-02-07","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"April Anthony","x":"We think that we can get that rightsizing to occur through a combination of attrition and organic growth, so that we can catch up that capacity that's created by the visit savings.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/07/encompass-health-corporation-ehc-q4-2019-earnings.aspx"},{"c":"EHC 2019 Q4","e":"ehc","d":"2020-02-07","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"April Anthony","x":"We certainly have experienced zero layoffs in the therapy division.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/07/encompass-health-corporation-ehc-q4-2019-earnings.aspx"},{"c":"EHC 2019 Q4","e":"ehc","d":"2020-02-07","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Mark J. Tarr","x":"With these growth and operational initiatives under way, we are reaffirming our 2020 guidance as communicated in January.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/07/encompass-health-corporation-ehc-q4-2019-earnings.aspx"},{"c":"EHC 2019 Q4","e":"ehc","d":"2020-02-07","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Doug Coltharp","x":"As Mark mentioned in his comments, we are reaffirming the 2020 guidance we initially provided in January, including an adjusted EBITDA range of $935 million to $965 million.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/07/encompass-health-corporation-ehc-q4-2019-earnings.aspx"},{"c":"EHC 2020 Q1","e":"ehc","d":"2020-04-30","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Mark J. Tarr","x":"As noted in our 8-K filing on April 16, with so much uncertainty, we withdrew our 2020 guidance.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/04/30/encompass-health-corporation-ehc-q1-2020-earnings.aspx"},{"c":"EHC 2020 Q3","e":"ehc","d":"2020-10-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Mark J. Tarr","x":"This change allowed us to save costs and do so in a manner that did not result in any broad furloughs, layoffs or terminations.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/30/encompass-health-corporation-ehc-q3-2020-earnings/"},{"c":"EHC 2021 Q1","e":"ehc","d":"2021-04-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Pito Chickering","x":"Cost per business continue to be held very consistently at these levels since you announced the restructuring last year, despite the COVID costs you guys saw during the quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/28/encompass-health-corporation-ehc-q1-2021-earnings/"},{"c":"EHC 2021 Q1","e":"ehc","d":"2021-04-28","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Doug Coltharp","x":"We increased our guidance assumption around bad debt in the range of 1.4% to 1.6% of revenue to a range of 1.5% to 1.7% of revenue, to reflect this trend.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/28/encompass-health-corporation-ehc-q1-2021-earnings/"},{"c":"EHC 2021 Q1","e":"ehc","d":"2021-04-28","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Doug Coltharp","x":"The raised guidance was solely attributable to those two factors.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/28/encompass-health-corporation-ehc-q1-2021-earnings/"},{"c":"EHC 2021 Q3","e":"ehc","d":"2021-10-28","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Mark J. Tarr","x":"Based on that expectation and our strong performance through the first half of the year, we increased our 2021 guidance for the second time this year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/10/28/encompass-health-corporation-ehc-q3-2021-earnings/"},{"c":"EHC 2026 Q1","e":"ehc","d":"2026-05-01","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Mark Tarr","x":"Based primarily on our Q1 results, we are raising our guidance for 2026.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/01/encompass-health-ehc-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"EHC 2026 Q1","e":"ehc","d":"2026-05-01","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Douglas Coltharp","x":"Based primarily on our Q1 results, we have raised our 2026 guidance as follows: we now expect net operating revenue of $6.375 billion to $6.470 billion, adjusted EBITDA of $1.35 billion to $1.38 billion and adjusted earnings per share of $5.89 to $6.11.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/01/encompass-health-ehc-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"EHC 2026 Q2","e":"ehc","d":"2026-08-06","l":"ai_spend","r":"analyst","s":"Albert Rice","x":"I just wondered also any update on your technology investments and AI initiatives?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/12/encompass-health-ehc-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"EHC 2026 Q2","e":"ehc","d":"2026-08-06","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Mark Tarr","x":"Based primarily on our Q2 results, we are again raising our guidance for 2026.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/12/encompass-health-ehc-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"EHC 2026 Q2","e":"ehc","d":"2026-08-06","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Douglas Coltharp","x":"As Mark mentioned, we have again raised our 2026 guidance as follows: we now expect for the full year net operating revenue of $6.41 billion to $6.49 billion, adjusted EBITDA of $1.365 billion to $1.395 billion and adjusted earnings per share of $6.02 to $6.25.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/12/encompass-health-ehc-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"EHC 2026 Q3","e":"ehc","d":"2026-10-29","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Douglas Coltharp","x":"Our MA discount for that quarter, it tends to widen out from Q3 to Q4 because MA price increases on a calendar basis and fee-for-service increases on a fiscal year basis was 2%.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/10/29/enc